      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "A nice cozy place to hangout for hours in Rawamangun. I tried their soto Betawi and it’s so good😭 All the staff was so nice too, so helpful with their recommendations. I was already happy but then they handed me my bill and it was so cheap?!😭 Aku pasti balik lagi. I love it here.",
