    {
      "name": "places/ChIJ6T1oUBr1aS4R3Ff6TFoG3e4/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2taaFoycHRlRVI0YlU0eWJrVnJPRVJYU2tRMVIyYxAB",
      "relativePublishTimeDescription": "a year ago",
      "rating": 5,
      "text": {
        "text": "One of the best places to hang out in the area — perfect for any occasion, whether you’re catching up with friends or just unwinding after a long day. The menu offers a great variety, from comforting Indonesian favorites to delicious Western classics, so there’s always something for everyone. The atmosphere is relaxed yet lively, and the service is warm and attentive.\n\nSome negative reviews may not reflect the true experience here; it’s worth visiting and judging for yourself. Many guests, myself included, have found this spot consistently enjoyable and worth coming back to.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
      "originalText": {
        "text": "One of the best places to hang out in the area — perfect for any occasion, whether you’re catching up with friends or just unwinding after a long day. The menu offers a great variety, from comforting Indonesian favorites to delicious Western classics, so there’s always something for everyone. The atmosphere is relaxed yet lively, and the service is warm and attentive.\n\nSome negative reviews may not reflect the true experience here; it’s worth visiting and judging for yourself. Many guests, myself included, have found this spot consistently enjoyable and worth coming back to.",
        "languageCode": "en"
      },
